# Line endings: git normalises text files to LF in the repository and gives
# each platform its own on checkout. Files that must keep their bytes are
# listed as binary.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# The vendored git-repokit-common tooling is not this project's language:
# GitHub's language statistics and diffs treat it as vendored.
scripts/repokit-common/** linguist-vendored
